Package: louksna-linux-bridge
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, openssl, util-linux (>= 2.15)
Recommends: systemd
Description: bounded read-only LOUKSNA local bridge
 LOUKSNA Linux Bridge provides the governed, read-only local transport,
 evidence ledger and loopback TLS 1.3/mTLS telemetry gateway.
 The package also provides a local graphical status and diagnostics panel.
 Package installation does not automatically create certificates, private
 keys, trust roots, privileged execution brokers, or remote ingress. An
 explicit local provisioning utility is shipped for a separate owner-reviewed
 action; it does not enable or start the service.
